{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15739","headline":"苦热 · 司空曙","name":"苦热","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暑气发炎州，焦烟远未收。\n啸风兼炽焰，挥汗讶成流。\n鹳鹊投林尽，龟鱼拥石稠。\n漱泉齐饮酎，衣葛剧兼裘。\n长簟贪欹枕，轻巾嬾挂头。\n招商如有曲，一爲取新秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15739.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15739","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}